      "content": "i dont think it's just a misunderstanding. every time i try to talk to a manager, they give me the runaround or send me to a different department. it's too consistent to be a coincidence. the fees happen right after i move money, like they're tracking my movements. i need to protect what's left of my funds before they finish this. what kind of defensive financial moves can i make to stop them from being able to pull this off? how do i stay one step ahead of them?",
