      "content": "diversifying sounds okay but if they're already watching me and flagging my activity, won't they just see those transfers as more \"suspicious\" behavior and hit me with more fees? i need more specific tactics to hide where the money is going or how to move it without triggering their internal alarms. how can i effectively mask my transactions so they can't track the liquidation process?",
